OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fand bright evening with some sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Cloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fthen spreading in from the west during
OL,9,Fthe early hours.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FMainly cloudy with rain in the
OL,12,Fmorning. Turning more showery in the
OL,13,Fafternoon, some of showers on the
OL,14,Fheavy side. Becoming drier and
OL,15,Fbrighter in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
